wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms (2.2.3.94-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add Linux 6.12 (vendor-next) support:
    - cfg80211_ch_switch_notify 3-arg / ch_switch_started_notify 5-arg
      signatures (6.9+), start_radar_detection ops link_id param (6.12+)
    - module core_layout -> mem[MOD_TEXT] (6.4+), explicit
      linux/sched/clock.h include for local_clock()
    - Makefile: silence -Wmissing-prototypes/-Wmissing-declarations/
      -Wold-style-declaration (6.12 kbuild enables them via WERROR)
    - verified: dkms build + module load on 6.1.172 and 6.12.69
  * prerm: drop hardcoded DKMS version 2.2.1.961 (broke remove/purge
    since the 2.2.3.94 rebase)

