wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms (2.2.3.94-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Update driver + firmware to vendor release v2.2.3.94 (from 2.2.1.961)
  * Vendor integrated in-tree: fw-download failure rescan (chip reset +
    mmc rescan) and >= 6.1.107 amsdu 8-arg signature handling
  * Only Makefile patch left: M=$(PWD) -> M=$(CURDIR) (DKMS make -C build)
  * ini: 1-antenna profile base (ant_mode=2, coex_ant_mode=2)
  * Firmware: H4-variant OEM 0366 (md5 c12fccf6..., device-proven with H4
    btattach) + native-batch PHY 4366 (replaces renamed 2186 file)

