wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms (2.2.1.961-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Ship /etc/modules-load.d/wq-wlan.conf (hci_uart + wq_wlan): the
    pre-firmware SDIO enumeration carries no modalias that maps to the
    driver, so udev cannot autoload wq_wlan; btattach additionally
    needs hci_uart's N_HCI line discipline. Previously these entries
    were written by the Armbian board config, which only runs at image
    build time — the package is now self-sufficient on existing
    installs

 -- Seeed Studio <techsupport@seeed.cc>  Thu, 28 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800

wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms (2.2.1.961-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial DKMS package for WQ9201S WiFi+BT combo module
  * Driver source: emu_wifi_sdio+bt_uart v2.2.1.961 (with 6.1 vendor
    kernel compatibility fixes and SDIO runtime pm hold)
  * Firmware set + wq_wlan_settings.ini (fw_sys=5) bound in the same package
  * wq9201s-bt.service: H4 btattach with wlan0 wait + MAC check + retry
  * postinst disables legacy AIC8800 drivers (chip replaced by WQ9201S)

